  "prefLabel": "Puc 502.06 Landfill gas",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 502.06 “Landfill gas” means any flammable consisting primarily of methane and carbon dioxide and produced by aerobic and anaerobic decomposition of organic solid waste in a landfill.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note # 1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Puc 500) #13794, eff 10-25-23",
